title: A New Government in Saxony
subtitle: The Landtag elects a minister-president.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: year = 1923 and month = 3
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.saxony_deal || Q.saxony_demand) {
    Q.st_saxony_gov = 'SPD minority government under Erich Zeigner, elected with Communist votes';
    Q.saxony_toleration = 1;
} else {
    Q.st_saxony_gov = 'Coalition of the SPD and DDP';
    Q.saxony_toleration = 0;
}
!}

= A New Government in Saxony

[? if saxony_toleration = 1 : On 21 March the Landtag elects Erich Zeigner minister-president with the votes of the SPD and the KPD. He promises a purge of reactionary officials and workers' defence against the right. In Berlin, the Reich government watches Dresden with alarm. ?][? if saxony_toleration = 0 : Without Communist votes the Saxon SPD forms a coalition with the Democrats. The left Social Democrats are bitter, at their own leaders and at the KPD. ?]

- @hold
- @turn

@hold
title: Hold Zeigner to his promises.
subtitle: More readiness and standing in Saxony.
view-if: saxony_toleration = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.readiness += 2;
Q.st_saxony_mod = (Q.st_saxony_mod || 0) + 1;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The Communist group meets the new minister-president every week with a list.

@turn
title: Turn the anger of the SPD's left against its leaders.
subtitle: Social Democratic workers blame their own party.
view-if: saxony_toleration = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.spd_discredit += 2;
Q.st_saxony_mod = (Q.st_saxony_mod || 0) + 1;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Party speakers go to the SPD's own meetings and read out the coalition agreement.
